    "sample": "NBA 2022-23, 2023-24, 2024-25, 2025-26 regular seasons and playoffs. Total of 54 series is too small for the stated question. If an engine for recommendations were built, it would require a much larger dataset of possessions.",
    "power": "Not applicable given untestability. If testable, power analysis would be required to determine the minimum detectable effect size for the relationship between adherence and winning, considering the likely small effect and high variance.",
    "controls": "Not applicable. If testable, controls would need to include: team strength (e.g., ELO rating), opponent strength, game state (score, time), player lineups, home/away advantage, coaching staff, and other concurrent offensive and defensive performance metrics.",
